{
    "title": "SmartHome (MSmartHome)",
    "description": "==The Red Dot Award 2023 Winner==\r\n\r\n\r\nSmartHome allows you to connect, monitor, and control smart appliances from Midea, Eureka, Pelonis, Comfee, Master Kitchen, Artic King, and MDV.\r\n\r\nSmartHome replaces the MSmartHome and Midea Air apps, providing a brand-new look and improved experience.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\r\nREMOTE CONTROL: Control your smart appliance anytime, from anywhere using your smart phone or watch. For example, cool down your room before you arrive home. *Make sure your watch is Wear OS 2 or above.\r\n\r\nVOICE CONTROL: Enjoy hands-free control of select appliances with Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, and Siri. \r\n\r\nNOTIFICATIONS: Never miss an important update or alert from your smart appliances. Receive timely notifications to alert you that the fridge door is open, or your oven has finished cooking dinner. \r\n\r\nAPPLIANCE STATUS: Monitor your smart appliances anytime, from anywhere. Check how much time is left on your laundry cycle or when your dishwasher will have the silverware ready for dinner. \r\n\r\nHELPFUL AUTOMATIONS: Make everyday life a little easier. Enable your air conditioner to automatically turn on when it is hot outside. Set a schedule for your dehumidifier to turn off at bedtime. \r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZABLE DEVICE CARDS: Quick access to your most used devices and controls from the app home page.\r\n\r\nSmartHome supports home appliances including air conditioners, vacuum cleaners, dehumidifiers, fans, ovens, washers & dryers, dishwashers, and more.\r\n\r\nAccess Permissions:\r\nThe following access permissions are required for the SmartHome (formerly MSmartHome) app to provide necessary services. If you do not allow them, you can still use the app except for the related services.\r\n- Bluetooth: Find and connect to nearby devices via Bluetooth or BLE.\r\n- Location: Detect home WLAN network information to add device. Check your location to automate actions when location changes. Search for local weather information in \"Scene\" function.\r\n- Camera: Scan QR codes to add device. Upload photo to report a repair or feedback.\r\n- Album: Scan saved QR codes. Edit your profile photo. Upload a photo to report a repair or feedback.\r\n\r\n\u203bThe availability of products and services may vary depending on the models you own or the region/country you reside in.",
    "descriptionHTML": "==The Red Dot Award 2023 Winner==<br><br><br>SmartHome allows you to connect, monitor, and control smart appliances from Midea, Eureka, Pelonis, Comfee, Master Kitchen, Artic King, and MDV.<br><br>SmartHome replaces the MSmartHome and Midea Air apps, providing a brand-new look and improved experience.<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br><br>REMOTE CONTROL: Control your smart appliance anytime, from anywhere using your smart phone or watch. For example, cool down your room before you arrive home. *Make sure your watch is Wear OS 2 or above.<br><br>VOICE CONTROL: Enjoy hands-free control of select appliances with Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, and Siri. <br><br>NOTIFICATIONS: Never miss an important update or alert from your smart appliances. Receive timely notifications to alert you that the fridge door is open, or your oven has finished cooking dinner. <br><br>APPLIANCE STATUS: Monitor your smart appliances anytime, from anywhere. Check how much time is left on your laundry cycle or when your dishwasher will have the silverware ready for dinner. <br><br>HELPFUL AUTOMATIONS: Make everyday life a little easier. Enable your air conditioner to automatically turn on when it is hot outside. Set a schedule for your dehumidifier to turn off at bedtime. <br><br>CUSTOMIZABLE DEVICE CARDS: Quick access to your most used devices and controls from the app home page.<br><br>SmartHome supports home appliances including air conditioners, vacuum cleaners, dehumidifiers, fans, ovens, washers &amp; dryers, dishwashers, and more.<br><br>Access Permissions:<br>The following access permissions are required for the SmartHome (formerly MSmartHome) app to provide necessary services. If you do not allow them, you can still use the app except for the related services.<br>- Bluetooth: Find and connect to nearby devices via Bluetooth or BLE.<br>- Location: Detect home WLAN network information to add device. Check your location to automate actions when location changes. Search for local weather information in &quot;Scene&quot; function.<br>- Camera: Scan QR codes to add device. Upload photo to report a repair or feedback.<br>- Album: Scan saved QR codes. Edit your profile photo. Upload a photo to report a repair or feedback.<br><br>\u203bThe availability of products and services may vary depending on the models you own or the region/country you reside in.",
